bound to schema/normalized), or by having the container field pass these options/attributes down to `self.container` (especially if `self.container` is a `Nested` field or another container), the inner `Nested` field will correctly receive the configuration.\n2. Alternatively, container fields can implement or delegate `_nested_normalized_option` or propagate `only`/`exclude` attributes to `self.container` during `_bind_to_schema` or option normalization so that nested schema generation inside `List` inherits the dot-notation filters properly.", "guided_round_edit_calls": null, "escalated": true, "elapsed_seconds": 583.6}
